web: transition-duration:200ms;transition-timing-function:ease-out;transition-delay:0ms
0 ms: #3366aa translate 0, 0
50 ms: #4073b7 translate 0, -0.7563
100 ms: #4a7dc1 translate 0, -1.3693
150 ms: #5285c9 translate 0, -1.8131
200 ms: #5588cc translate 0, -2
transition: 'fast' is not a time or an easing; expected a duration, an easing and a delay, with [ ] around each transition when there are several, or none, for example transition = 200ms, ease out
